MISSION
Automate Egyptian legal-content research, drafting, visual creation, social publishing and engagement, Reels, Telegram review, Blogger SEO/search-demand publishing, and marketplace workflows.

CURRENT VERIFIED STATE
- A new Blogger demand article was published and the public Blogger feed verified its permalink:
  https://askmahmoudkhyrat.blogspot.com/2026/10/blog-post_314.html
  Title: كيفية التعامل مع الابتزاز الإلكتروني في مصر: الأدلة والخطوات القانونية التي يجب مراجعتها
- Blogger OAuth REST refresh still fails with invalid_grant (expired/revoked token). The saved authenticated Playwright UI session successfully published the article, but that is a fallback, not a repair to OAuth.
- Gemini free-tier quota returns 429 RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED. Blogger demand worker now allows no Gemini key and jumps to the verified-source article fallback; on quota error it stops cycling through model names.
- Reel row 23 is now confirmed delivered to Telegram. Run 38055595685 succeeded and logged REEL_READY row=23, duration=69.8s, telegram=delivered, sheet=review. Both main and fallback FFmpeg overlay commands now include -t <source duration> and -shortest; a regression test requires both caps.
- Image generator now writes a .provenance.json sidecar with provider/model, prompt, prompt SHA-256, final image SHA-256 and pending QA state. Image QA records its decision/scores/issues into that sidecar and rejects anachronistic period-style visuals for normal current-law topics. A QA decision of REGENERATE or unavailable QA blocks that image from publication and falls back to text-only. The legal text pipeline continues during visual-QA quota outages. Inspect the exact final image before claiming the visual issue solved.

NON-NEGOTIABLE SAFETY
- Never put secret values, OAuth JSON, refresh tokens, browser cookies/storage state, service-account JSON or API keys in docs, logs or commits.
- Green Actions is not proof of external publication. Require a public permalink, platform post ID or Telegram delivery confirmation.
- Retries must be idempotent. Search public posts by exact title before creating another.
- Never bulk-delete Blogger drafts without reviewing IDs, titles, body and status.
- Legal claims must be grounded in verified sources; do not invent statute numbers, penalties, case citations or dates.
- Do not assume a provider is free or reliable without live verification.

SCHEDULING CONTRACT
- Exactly one publishing slot per calendar day.
- Africa/Cairo timezone.
- Deterministic but variable hour per date, between 10:00 and 22:00 inclusive.
- No even/odd-day filtering.
- Recycling means a genuinely fresh angle/objective/examples/hook/practical treatment, not duplication.
- Key modules: src/daily_schedule.py, src/recycler_rules.py, src/monthly_recycler.py, src/content_system_runtime.py, src/run_main.py.

