LATEST OPERATING CONTRACT — 2026-10-21
LINKEDIN: Never reuse Facebook copy. LinkedIn is a standalone professional B2B legal-business post for company owners, management, HR, legal, compliance and operations. Target 350–600 Arabic words when topic supports it; current depth gate ~350 words and safe cap 2,900 chars. Discuss business impact, risk, documents, responsibility and decision points. Do not address the reader as أنت/إنت/عندك. Every path, including image repair, must generate LinkedIn-specific copy. Fix committed as 606223916b2b2900c49c7805b80694679dbac8ed; runtime/test verification remains pending.

GENERAL WRITING: Verify current Egyptian law; never invent statutes, penalties, court citations, dates, quotations or sources. Use natural professional Egyptian Arabic, no robotic filler, AI disclosure, internal planning labels, ellipses or incomplete endings. No hard-sell CTA. Distinct platform copy; recycled topics need a materially new angle.

SCHEDULE: Exactly one slot/day; Africa/Cairo; deterministic variable time 10:00–22:00 inclusive; no odd/even-day filter. Retries idempotent; never duplicate already-published posts. Green job/dialog closure is not proof: require permalink, platform post ID or Telegram receipt.

IMAGE: Send post-derived visual description directly; avoid arbitrary restrictions and irrelevant Pharaonic imagery. Keep provider/model/prompt hash/final image hash/QA in provenance. Latest code removes negative_prompt and makes visual QA advisory/fail-open; verify tests and inspect actual image before treating as resolved.

REEL: Actual daily path only, not pilot. One subtitle box; full spoken sentence wrapped and fully in-frame; no duplicate layer, clipping or truncation. Burn once and cap duration with -t <source duration> and -shortest on main/fallback paths. Verify actual MP4, Telegram receipt and YouTube Shorts URL/ID when enabled. Single-box changes are not yet end-to-end verified.

ENGAGEMENT: Intended variable 3–7 contextual comments per post/platform; queue worker at most one pending comment per run where configured; idempotent. Do not assume LinkedIn w_member_social_feed exists; previously confirmed scope is w_member_social.

BLOGGER: Verified article https://askmahmoudkhyrat.blogspot.com/2026/10/blog-post_314.html. Blogger OAuth invalid_grant requires owner reauthorization if persistent; update BLOGGER_OAUTH_JSON securely. Gemini 429 means use verified-source fallback rather than cycling model names. Normalize labels below 200 chars. Verify Published state and public permalink; do not bulk-delete drafts.

